## Visual Studio resource script is UTF-16; store as UTF-8 in the repo so diffs work
*.rc text working-tree-encoding=UTF-16LE-BOM eol=crlf
## Binary resources
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
samples/*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
samples/*.h264 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
